Electron adaptation notes (43-x-y):
Applied on top of Electron's existing M150-LTS pick for crbug.com/552665794 (cherry-pick-8068cdd59a8d.patch), which already carries the EnumerateDirectory weak-frame check, the RenderFrameHostImpl* signature and the DetachFrameOnFullscreenExitDelegate test helper. Only the remaining hunks were applied: ShowCreatedWindow() re-reads the delegate after dropping fullscreen, ViewSource() drops fullscreen before reading NavigationEntries and checks delegate_, EnumerateDirectory() gains the CHECK(render_frame_host), SetContentsBounds() checks delegate_. WebContentsImpl::MoveWindowTo()/ResizeWindowTo() do not exist on M150, so those two hunks were dropped. The EnumerateDirectory() definition's parameter type change to RenderFrameHostImpl* (matching the header) is included.

